And distance models.  Here's a recently published paper that may be of interest.

Oedekoven, Cornelia S., Stephen T. Buckland, Monique L. Mackenzie, Kristine O. Evans, Loren W. Burger. 2013. Improving distance sampling: accounting for covariates and non-independency between sampled sites. Journal of Applied Ecology. In Press. http://dx.doi.org/10.1111/1365-2664.12065

